# settings-stacked (M12): the settings panel in the stacked layout (800 x 900), hanging from the
# gear at the bar's right end, over the panel and the plane; the wheel over it scrolls the page,
# which carries the bar and the panel with it, as the panel sits in the bar (React's position:
# absolute in the gear's wrap). At 800 x 900 in the reference's DOM: the gear (723, 28, 40 x 40),
# the panel (459, 76, 304 x 256), its help line (472, 155, 278 x 18).
size 800 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode system
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 743 48
wait 700
move 600 164
wait 16
shot open
wheel 0 100
wait 300
shot scrolled
